## Troubleshooting

### CloudFront retorna 403 Forbidden

**Causa**: Bucket policy incorreta
**Solução**: Verificar se Origin Access Identity está configurado

```bash
aws cloudfront get-distribution-config --id DIST_ID
```

### Lambda timeout error

**Causa**: Função demora muito
**Solução**: Aumentar timeout e memória

```bash
aws lambda update-function-configuration \
  --function-name portfolio-contact-form \
  --timeout 60 \
  --memory-size 512
```

### S3 Access Denied

**Causa**: IAM permissions
**Solução**: Revisar bucket policies

```bash
aws s3api get-bucket-policy --bucket SEU-BUCKET
```

### Verificar Logs

```bash
# Lambda logs
aws logs tail /aws/lambda/portfolio-contact-form --follow

# CloudFront logs
aws s3 sync s3://logs-bucket/cloudfront/ ./logs/
```

